# crater-targets-2026-11-04

Inputs and summary of the fontc_crater targets update for google/fonts#11225 (the 16
binary-only families Black And White Picture, Black Han Sans, Cute Font, Dokdo, East Sea
Dokdo, Gamja Flower, Gugi, Hi Melody, Lato, Nanum Brush Script, Nanum Gothic, Nanum Pen
Script, Poor Story, Song Myung, Stylish, Sunflower), on googlefonts/fontc_crater main 2c7b075.

- `generated.json`: google-fonts-sources d7db2d8 run against google/fonts e4a37edc3 (the
  merge of #11225): `google-fonts-sources <dir> -o generated.json`, with `<dir>/google/fonts`
  a detached worktree of the google/fonts clone at that commit (its `origin/HEAD` points at
  `origin/main`). `generate.log` is the tool's output (empty).
- `merge.txt`: what `tools/crater_targets.py <fontc_crater 2c7b075 targets.json>
  generated.json` reported: 1475 -> 1491 entries, 16 added, none removed, no rev change,
  googlesans-flex kept by hand. The result is the branch's targets.json.
- Crater on the 16 added entries before the PR: logs/crater-local-2026-11-04 (74 of 74).
